				<attribute key="text" type="String">Do you know the difference between "2"+"2" and 2+2? We have talked about this in the lecture on "Data Types" and also in the contextual hints for problems like "Simple interest".</attribute>
				<attribute key="fontSize" type="int">12</attribute>
				<attribute key="fontName" type="String">Dialog</attribute>
