		<section name="node">
			<attribute key="id" type="int">37</attribute>
			<attribute key="label" type="String">This is correct answer.

a is of number type, so a+a will do arithmetic addition. Thus, 2+2 will give 4.

But b is of string type, so b+b will do string addition. Thus "2"+"2" will give "22".

Note the use of double quotes for b and no double quotes for a.</attribute>
			<section name="graphics">
				<attribute key="x" type="double">1115.7619047619048</attribute>
				<attribute key="y" type="double">2788.6190247196846</attribute>
				<attribute key="w" type="double">286.6327376644169</attribute>
				<attribute key="h" type="double">159.12146658036033</attribute>
