		<section name="node">
			<attribute key="id" type="int">39</attribute>
			<attribute key="label" type="String">One point to note in this assignment is that each line of output also requires different number of additions. So, step 3 of our algorithm will get translated into something like below.

Suppose we want to print ith line.
a. Initiate outputValue to be empty string
b. Repeat the below step for i times
c. Replace outputValue with outputValue + i</attribute>
			<section name="graphics">
				<attribute key="x" type="double">765.0630952380952</attribute>
				<attribute key="y" type="double">2996.441663175045</attribute>
				<attribute key="w" type="double">286.6327376644169</attribute>
				<attribute key="h" type="double">159.12146658036033</attribute>
				<attribute key="type" type="String">rectangle</attribute>
				<attribute key="raisedBorder" type="boolean">false</attribute>
				<attribute key="fill" type="String">#FFCC00</attribute>
				<attribute key="outline" type="String">#000000</attribute>
			</section>
			<section name="LabelGraphics">
				<attribute key="text" type="String">One point to note in this assignment is that each line of output also requires different number of additions. So, step 3 of our algorithm will get translated into something like below.

Suppose we want to print ith line.
a. Initiate outputValue to be empty string
b. Repeat the below step for i times
c. Replace outputValue with outputValue + i</attribute>
				<attribute key="fontSize" type="int">12</attribute>
				<attribute key="fontName" type="String">Dialog</attribute>
