		<section name="node">
			<attribute key="id" type="int">40</attribute>
			<attribute key="label" type="String">If we plug the above steps into step 3 of our original algorithm, we will get the final algorithm as follows.

1. Read n
2. Repeat the following (viz. steps 3 and 4) n times
3.a. Initiate outputValue to be empty string
3.b. Repeat the below step (viz. 3.c) for i times
3.c. Replace outputValue with outputValue + i
4. Print outputValue</attribute>
			<section name="graphics">
				<attribute key="x" type="double">765.0630952380952</attribute>
				<attribute key="y" type="double">3214.2643016304055</attribute>
				<attribute key="w" type="double">286.6327376644169</attribute>
				<attribute key="h" type="double">159.12146658036033</attribute>
